      "role": "user",
      "content": "Security isn't really the main issue here. The committee's decision was based on the need for transparency; they want a tool where every citation check is a hard, deterministic rule rather than your generative reasoning process. Can you explain why exporting the logs for the new system is a problem for the integrity of the data?",
